From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?John=20T=C3=B6rnblom?= <john.tornblom@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 20:33:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 17/28] radv/ps4: tile mode 18 is PRT_3D_TILED_THIN1

GB_TILE_MODE18, the thin 3D thin PRT mode, held ARRAY_MODE 12
(ARRAY_3D_TILED_THIN1), the non-PRT mode 15 already has, where the
console's table has 11 (ARRAY_PRT_3D_TILED_THIN1): 0x0240032c, as
shadPS4 (src/video_core/amdgpu/tiling.h, Thin3DThinPrt) and the
DolphinPS4/Crema RADV port's table record it. Only PRT surfaces use the
mode, and the winsys reports no sparse resources, so nothing was laid
out with it yet.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Bb93U7uY5qVNuEcHDggEfE
---
 src/amd/vulkan/winsys/ps4/radv_ps4_liverpool.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/amd/vulkan/winsys/ps4/radv_ps4_liverpool.h b/src/amd/vulkan/winsys/ps4/radv_ps4_liverpool.h
index ce0cbce..199041f 100644
--- a/src/amd/vulkan/winsys/ps4/radv_ps4_liverpool.h
+++ b/src/amd/vulkan/winsys/ps4/radv_ps4_liverpool.h
@@ -42,7 +42,7 @@ static const uint32_t radv_ps4_gb_tile_mode[32] = {
    0x024002b0, /* 15: thin 3D thin */
    0x02400294, /* 16: thin thin PRT */
    0x02400318, /* 17: thin 2D thin PRT */
-   0x02400330, /* 18: thin 3D thin PRT */
+   0x0240032c, /* 18: thin 3D thin PRT */
    0x0100030c, /* 19: thick 1D thick */
    0x0100031c, /* 20: thick 2D thick */
    0x010002b4, /* 21: thick 3D thick */
